张氏〖18〗，大赦。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-845d7b026cba7bbd2b9d","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-40db16cbc0a5788fa626","layer":"pei","quote":"嘉平四年四月，孙权死","attribution":"裴注·司马彪《战略》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":521,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-95568ac79fb311f2266b","start":33,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o167a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-bdac20a950baa8638d97","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，权薨〖16〗。时年七十一，谥曰大皇帝。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":303,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o166","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b62c4eca93eda253f3b0","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖12〗，立故太子和为南阳王，居长沙〖13〗；子奋为齐王，居武昌；子休为琅邪王〖14〗，居虎林〖15〗。二月，大赦，改元为神凤。皇后潘氏薨。诸将吏数诣王表请福，表亡去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":302,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
